DESCRIPTION:After multiple sold-out seasons across Australia and a 5-star r
 eview at Fringe World Perth \, Unsettled: The Search Between Wandering & B
 elonging returns to the Gold Coast\, for a special one-night performance. 
 One woman. One suitcase. Too many existential crisis. What happens when ho
 me is no longer a place you can find on a map? Unsettled: The Search Betwe
 en Wandering & Belonging is a fearless\, funny\, and deeply moving one-wom
 an show about chasing dreams\, getting lost along the way\, and building a
  new life from scratch. With humour and intimate honesty\, Agustina takes 
 you on a wild ride through the heartbreak\, comedy\, and chaos of living a
 broad. Vulnerable\, hilarious\, and fiercely alive\, Unsettled invites you
  to feel seen\, laugh\, cry\, and maybe even find a piece of yourself alon
 g the way. What began as a street performance in Port Douglas has evolved 
 into a multi-city\, sold-out show \, touring Magnetic Island\, Airlie Beac
 h\, Noosa\, Byron Bay\, Gold Coast\, Margaret River\, and successful sell 
 out seasons at Adelaide Fringe\, Fringe World Perth\, Sydney Fringe & Melb
 ourne Fringe. Following a successful Byron Bay season\, with nine performa
 nces and multiple sold-out nights\, Unsettled heads just up the coast to G
 old Coast. After previously appearing at Miami Marketta as part of HOLA Ma
 rketta the Winter Latin Festival \, the show returns for a special standal
 one performance\, bringing its playful storytelling to new audiences. This
  time\, experience it in a cozy\, intimate venue\, perfect for getting up 
 close and personal with the story. ⚠️Limited capacity. One night only.
  Don’t miss out 😏 ⏰ Doors open 6PM Show 7PM - 9PM 📌 Miami Market
 ta\, Mona Lisa's Lair More than just a show! Enjoy live music before the p
 erformance \, grab a drink and settle in for the evening. Following the sh
 ow\, there will be a Q&A and informal discussion with Agustina \, explorin
 g and unpacking some of the themes at the heart of Unsettled . Come for th
 e story. Stay for the conversation
